 494:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @return the mixed color
 495:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @note 255 won't give clearly `c1`.
