 522:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @param bg_opa alpha of the background color
 523:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @param fg_color foreground color
 524:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @param fg_opa alpha of the foreground color
 525:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @param res_color the result color
